                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P> </P>
<DIV class=WordSection1>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 5.95pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face=宋体><FONT size=5><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt">各区、县</SPAN>（市<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.25pt">）</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt">教研室</SPAN>（<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt">教师发展中心</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -8.2pt">）</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt">，市直学校：<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 12.4pt 13.1pt 0pt 5.95pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 137%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face=宋体><FONT size=5>为进一步改善学生的学习方式、培养学生学以致用、综合解决实际问题的能力，决定举行绍兴中小学生研究性学习活动成果评比活动，现将有关事项通知如下：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<H2 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 37.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24.8pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face="Microsoft JhengHei">一、评比时间<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></H2>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 6.3pt 0cm 0pt 37.85pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 等线; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast'>2017 </SPAN><FONT face=宋体>年 </FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>11 </SPAN><FONT face=宋体>月<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<H2 style="MARGIN: 1.8pt 0cm 0pt 38.1pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face="Microsoft JhengHei">二、评比内容<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></H2>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 6.25pt 0cm 0pt 37.85pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face=宋体><FONT size=5>小课题研究、调查报告、学科小论文<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<H2 style="MARGIN: 2.7pt 0cm 0pt 38.1pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face="Microsoft JhengHei">三、评比要求<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></H2>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 6.25pt 10.15pt 0pt 5.95pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 等线; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast'>2017 </SPAN><FONT face=宋体>年 </FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>9 </SPAN><FONT face=宋体>月前结题的个人或小组合作产生的学生成果，已在市级及以上单位举办的活动中获奖的成果不再参加评比。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 3.15pt 0cm 0pt 37.85pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT face=宋体><FONT size=5>具体评比要求如下：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 8.1pt 4.3pt 0pt 5.95pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 等线; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast'>1</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.35pt">．参评的成果材料应如实地反映学生在学习过程中，通过多</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt">种学习或实践方式取得的成果和真实体验，内容丰富，思路清晰。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P></DIV><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'><BR style="PAGE-BREAK-BEFORE: always; mso-break-type: section-break" clear=all></SPAN>
<DIV class=WordSection2>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 0.2pt 0cm 0pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 8pt"><o:p><FONT face=宋体> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 0.65pt 13.6pt 0pt 5.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.45pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 等线; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast'>2</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt">．成果的作者应是学生。可以是个人成果，也可以是集体成</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt">果。集体成果署名不多于 </SPAN></FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>5 </SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.55pt"><FONT face=宋体>个。指导老师不超过 </FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>2 </SPAN><FONT face=宋体>个。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 1.55pt 0cm 0pt 37.55pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 等线; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast'>3</SPAN><FONT face=宋体>．成果以文字说明为主，适当配以图片和图示。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 8.8pt 13.65pt 0pt 5.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 等线; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast'>4</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt"><FONT face=宋体>．成果应简洁明了，注意控制字数。小学、初中 </FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt'>3000</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 3.45pt'> </SPAN><FONT face=宋体>字以<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt">内，高中 </SPAN></FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt'>5000 </SPAN><FONT face=宋体>字以内。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 1.7pt 13.6pt 0pt 5.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.45pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 等线; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast'>5</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt">．上报成果时，应将学生所写的文本、相关实物作品照片和</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.25pt">实践过程的照片、有关视频等作为附件一起打包递交。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 3.85pt 11pt 0pt 5.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 等线; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast'>6</SPAN><FONT face=宋体>．上报的成果请在封面左上角注明类别。如小学</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>—</SPAN><FONT face=宋体>小课题、小学</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>—</SPAN><FONT face=宋体>调查报告；初中</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>—</SPAN><FONT face=宋体>小课题、初中</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>—</SPAN><FONT face=宋体>调查报告、初中</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>—</SPAN><FONT face=宋体>小论文；高中</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>—</SPAN><FONT face=宋体>小课题、高中</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>—</SPAN><FONT face=宋体>调查报告、高中</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>—</SPAN><FONT face=宋体>小论文等。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<H2 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 37.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24.5pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face="Microsoft JhengHei">四、体例格式<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></H2>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 8.2pt 13.65pt 0pt 5.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -1.65pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 等线; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast'>1</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -1.15pt">．封面标明课题名称、研究时间、学校、班级、指导老师</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.25pt">（</SPAN>联<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt">系方式</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -7.95pt">）</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt">、作者或小组成员。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 3.85pt 13.45pt 0pt 5.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.45pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 等线; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast'>2</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt">．内容正文用小四号宋体，标题用小三号黑体；行间距为固</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -1.5pt">定值 </SPAN></FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>22 </SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -1.45pt"><FONT face=宋体>磅。采用 </FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt'>Word </SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt"><FONT face=宋体>文档，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt'>A4 </SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -1.05pt"><FONT face=宋体>纸，页边距设置上、下为 </FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>2.54cm, </SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.75pt"><FONT face=宋体>左、右为 </FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt'>2.2cm</SPAN><FONT face=宋体>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 1.7pt 0cm 0pt 5.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 等线; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast'>3</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.35pt">．附件是帮助评委了解研究过程的真实性、科学性以及成果</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -1.25pt">的一些原始文字材料，附件总页数一般情况控制在 </SPAN></FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt'>A4 </SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -2.35pt"><FONT face=宋体>纸 </FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>10 </SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt"><FONT face=宋体>页以内。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></FONT></P>
