<P class=MsoBodyText style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 1.95pt 13.3pt 0pt 5.95pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.45pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 等线; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast'>3</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.35pt">．纸质一式四份</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.25pt">（</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -1.05pt">其中 </SPAN></FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>3 </SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.25pt">份不出现单位名称、作者和指导教</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt">师姓名等相关信息</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -8.2pt">）</SPAN>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 3.75pt 5.15pt 0pt 5.95pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 等线; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast'>4</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt">．附件、电子稿、承诺书各一份，由各区、县</SPAN>（<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.25pt">市）</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt">教研室</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt">在评比的基础上，择优、汇总后统一报送我院</SPAN>（<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt">绍兴市新河弄 </SPAN></FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>66 </SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -2.55pt"><FONT face=宋体>号，联系人：张静，联系电话：</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt'>8</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt'>8</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt'>9</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt'>0</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt'>59</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt'>7</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt'>0</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -3.75pt"><FONT face=宋体>。邮箱：</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><A><SPAN style='TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; COLOR: windowtext; LETTER-SPACING: -0.25pt; text-underline: none'>s</SPAN><SPAN style='TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; COLOR: windowtext; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; text-underline: none'>x</SPAN><SPAN style='TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; COLOR: windowtext; LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt; text-underline: none'>jk</SPAN><SPAN style='TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; COLOR: windowtext; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; text-underline: none'>y</SPAN><SPAN style='TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; COLOR: windowtext; LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt; text-underline: none'>20</SPAN><SPAN style='TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; COLOR: windowtext; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; text-underline: none'>0</SPAN><SPAN style='TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; COLOR: windowtext; LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt; text-underline: none'>9</SPAN><SPAN style='TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; COLOR: windowtext; LETTER-SPACING: -0.45pt; text-underline: none'>@</SPAN><SPAN style='TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; COLOR: windowtext; LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt; text-underline: none'>1</SPAN><SPAN style='TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; COLOR: windowtext; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; text-underline: none'>6</SPAN><SPAN style='TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; COLOR: windowtext; LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt; text-underline: none'>3</SPAN><SPAN style='TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; COLOR: windowtext; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; text-underline: none'>.c</SPAN><SPAN style='TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; COLOR: windowtext; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; text-underline: none'>o</SPAN><SPAN style='TEXT-DECORATION: none; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; COLOR: windowtext; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; text-underline: none'>m</SPAN></A></SPAN></SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -8.2pt">）</SPAN>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<H2 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 37.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24.55pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face="Microsoft JhengHei">六、评比<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></H2>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 9.15pt 13.2pt 0pt 5.95pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 148%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 等线; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast'>1</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt"><FONT face=宋体>．本次评比按参评成果篇目总数的 </FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>80%</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.55pt"><FONT face=宋体>取奖，以 </FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif'>2:3:5 </SPAN><FONT face=宋体>的比例设一、二、三等奖；获一等奖成果的指导教师同时获市优秀指<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt">导教师奖。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 3.1pt 13.3pt 0pt 5.95pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-INDENT: 31.9pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: -0.45pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 等线; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast'>2</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt">．拟获得高中组一等奖成果的作者</SPAN>（<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt">含小组成员</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.75pt">）</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt">须参加面</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.15pt">试答辩后予以确认。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoBodyText style="MARGIN: 3.75pt 0cm 0pt 37.85pt; punctuation-wrap: simple; mso-line-break-override: restrictions"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 等线; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast'>3</SPAN><FONT face=宋体>．本次评比的评委由我院统一聘请。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P></DIV><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'><BR style="PAGE-BREAK-BEFORE: always; mso-break-type: section-break" clear=all></SPAN>
